Notes related to bmail suite v0.3

This version represents a significant code refactor over v0.2, implementing 
a dtpc layer on top of BP for elision and optional reliability 
acknowledgement services, in addition to zlib compression of payload data.

This code compiles, but does not entirely work yet, and is filled with 
checkpointing and other instrumentation code included for debugging 
purposes. To replace the default v0.2 release, also included in the 
bpv7/test directory, edit the appropriate lines of Makefile.am to comment 
out the bundlemailer/mailbundler components from the BPv7 section, and 
uncomment the appropriate lines of the DTPC section.
